        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a postman in a world of robots!</strong><br>Take on the role of an automated courier whose mission is to deliver important letters and help local residents along the way. But every delivery is more than just a route — it’s a choice: will you rush to the next addressee or stop to lend a hand to those in need?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Explore cities</strong><br>Each level is a maze of streets and houses. Find the right path through the stone jungles, overcome obstacles, and complete your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📬 <strong>Unique challenges</strong><br>Every city hides its own special order. Solve puzzles, discover shortcuts, and make sure every letter reaches its destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 <strong>Your story as a postman</strong><br>How you play determines what kind of postman you become — fast and efficient, or caring and helpful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the metal shoes of a robot postman and prove that even machines can deliver more than just letters — they can bring kindness.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a postman in a world of robots!</strong><br>Take on the role of an automated courier whose mission is to deliver important letters and help local residents along the way. But every delivery is more than just a route — it’s a choice: will you rush to the next addressee or stop to lend a hand to those in need?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Explore cities</strong><br>Each level is a maze of streets and houses. Find the right path through the stone jungles, overcome obstacles, and complete your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📬 <strong>Unique challenges</strong><br>Every city hides its own special order. Solve puzzles, discover shortcuts, and make sure every letter reaches its destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 <strong>Your story as a postman</strong><br>How you play determines what kind of postman you become — fast and efficient, or caring and helpful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the metal shoes of a robot postman and prove that even machines can deliver more than just letters — they can bring kindness.</p>",
        "short_description": "Welcome to a world where even robots can care! You are an automated postman whose task is to deliver important letters to every corner of the city.",
